cff-version: 1.2.0
title: LaredocMind
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the bachelor thesis and the
  conference paper listed below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gabriel
    family-names: Gómez García
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3573-2541"
    affiliation: Universidad de Cantabria
repository-code: "https://github.com/Gabiz053/LaredocMind"
abstract: >-
  Retrieval-augmented conversational assistant for LAREDO, the MLOps platform
  of the ISTR research group at the University of Cantabria. Built with
  LangChain and LangGraph over ChromaDB and Gemini, with a Flask backend and a
  React widget published on npm.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - large language models
  - conversational assistant
  - MLOps
license: MIT
date-released: "2025-06-27"
